Fri Oct 23 16:36:17 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.5.0:
  * Port to Qt6 and C++20
  * Support GCC 14 and 15, Clang 19 and 20 toolchains
  * Fix possible crash on amp models with less than 100 presets
  * Mustang v1/v2 improvements, FX loop controls and more v2 amp models
  * Many more fixes and improvements; see upstream release notes
- Drop 0001-Improve-udev-rules-add-uaccess-support.patch and
  add_missing_cstdint.patch: fixed upstream
- Rebase 0001-Build-helper-libraries-as-OBJECT-libraries.patch
- Drop mustang-plug.svg source, the icon is shipped upstream now
- Adjust install section to the upstream layout (cmake config location,
  fixed desktop file, no custom udev/desktop paths)

